-owned physical-frame budget\n- charge private Linux mmap, stack, exec, COW, process, tmpfs, and SysV memory to the container domain\n- preserve kernel ownership for page tables and globally shared immutable file-cache pages\n- retain the existing supervised-service frame ceiling\n\n## Verification\n\n- `cargo check --package ginux-kernel --target x86_64-unknown-none`\n- `make check` (unsafe inventory unchanged at 1,033 blocks)\n- `make test`\n- deterministic atomic mmap-style and independent SysV quota exhaustion markers\n\nRef: #19\n\nThis PR does not merge or close the issue.", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2026-11-02T03:30:09Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-03T00:06:08Z", "closed_at": "2026-11-03T00:05:06Z", "merged_at": "2026-11-03T00:05:06Z", "merge_commit_sha": "82df3d719e14246233d509799ad220c4c39e7088", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "gmkurtzer:hdae/issue-19-domain-memory", "ref": "hdae/issue-19-domain-memory", "repo": {"id": 1413787216, "node_id": "R_kgDOVESuUA", "name": "ginux", "full_name": "gmkurtzer/ginux", "owner": {"login": "gmkurtzer", "id": 13984965, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTg0OTY1", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13984965?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer", "html_url": "https://github.com/gmkurtzer", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/events{/privacy}", "recei